# Generated artifacts: never hand-merge them.
#
# docs/*.html and guide/*.html are Quarto build outputs of guide/workflow-guide.qmd.
# A merge conflict in them carries no intent — the correct content is whatever
# `quarto render` produces from the merged source. The keep-ours driver resolves
# them silently; scripts/stamp-render.sh then fails loudly if the committed HTML
# does not match the source it claims to come from, so a forgotten re-render
# cannot ship.
#
# Requires `git config merge.keep-ours.driver true` in each clone — see
# scripts/fork-setup.sh.
docs/*.html          merge=keep-ours
guide/*.html         merge=keep-ours
